        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana RNE, Modern Stainless Steel 4 Inch House Numbers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Modern Stainless Steel House Numbers are available in brushed stainless steel or matte black finishes. Each Series E 4 Inch Address Number is packaged with the optional stand-offs to float mount it with a 11/16 inch projection. The Modern Stainless Steel 4 Inch House Numbers can also be flush mounted. The Modern Font Address Numbers are surface mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/4-inch-modern-stainless-steel-address-letter-deltana-rne-letters\"><b>Address Letters</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Deltana Modern Font Address Numbers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .275\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware for surface mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Can be mounted flush or floating.</li>\r\n<li>There are variances in height for specific digits. Please <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-RNE-specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\" target=\"new\"><b>CLICK HERE to see the specifications of each number (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-RNE-finishes.jpg?v=1704354723\" width=\"394\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana RNE Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
